"The registry on the Overview tab lists every provider the gateway can route to, but only *custom*"
" providers are editable there. A provider that code or the model registry already owns — the "
"built-in adapter kinds, and any `provider:` label a route declares — is read-only in this table, "
"and a stored definition that reuses one of those slugs is skipped at boot rather than allowed to "
"shadow it. Custom providers are `openai_compat` only; a protocol the generic adapter cannot speak"
" needs an adapter, which is a code change ([Adding a New Provider](adding-models.md#adding-a-new-"
