#: ../developer/configuration.md:330
msgid ""
"The registry is loaded first and the stored state is applied on top of it, in this order at boot;"
" each admin change is also applied to the running router the moment it is saved."
msgstr "先加载注册表，再把已存状态按下面的顺序套在它之上；每个管理改动在保存的那一刻也会被套到运行中的路由器上。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:334
msgid "Custom provider definitions, skipping any slug the code or registry owns."
msgstr "自定义 provider 定义，跳过代码或注册表已拥有的任何 slug。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:335
